ll><mxCell id="n711" value="&lt;b&gt;6 All tables together (busy overview)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every line is a foreign key: it starts at the FK column's row and ends at the table it references (line colour = that table). Where two lines cross, the line hops over: lines never join. Line ends: crow's foot = zero or many, bar = exactly one, circle = zero or one (nullable FK). Key columns only (PK, FK, UK); pages 1-5 show every column, with no crossing lines. The &quot;who recorded / created it&quot; links to users are shown as small grey users boxes beside the column." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1556" width="1400" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>